Lucene in runtimes/
-------------------

The Lucene jars in the folder runtimes/ beside leia.jar are not part of this
distribution. leia downloads them on request from Maven Central
(https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/), unchanged, as the Apache Software
Foundation publishes them; each carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE.
